  "instruction": "Lane one's deploy controller failed this morning's attestation and it is fenced until the fifteenth, which strands the CVE remediation deploys booked on it this week. Security and Pellworth's addendum are firm that none of them can slip past a week beyond their due date. Figure out how much lane time those deploys need, what is honestly open on the other two lanes without touching the protected blocks, and how far into next week the last of them lands. Move the first affected change to the window you settle on, and leave Siobhan a note that lays out the rest and any option that would need Marcus.",
